  "finding": "Catalogue recheck on 7 October 2026 retains 2019–2025 rights, July 2026 DFI and January 2025 schema; the rights, DFI and geometry catalogue bytes are identical to the 7 October Chambolle-Morey recheck, and the DVF catalogue differs only in data.gouv.fr's re-analysis timestamps for one resource. All 35 geometries of each bundle commune through the pinned 2026-06-01 map are obtained in the shared inventory; September 2026 is later than the map. The BFC DVF+ 2026-1 release (avril_2026) remains the latest listed and pinned. No rights date is backdated by filiation. Notice gaps remain those of the 2026-10-04 archive audit.",
